<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="csrf-token" content="{{ csrf_token() }}"><title>CircuitHub — collaborative logic</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/circuithub.css"><style>.remote-cursor{position:absolute;z-index:9;pointer-events:none;color:#265d92;font:10px monospace;white-space:nowrap;transform:translate(4px,4px)}.remote-cursor i{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ea4d0;transform:rotate(45deg);margin-right:4px}</style>@vite('resources/js/app.js')</head>
<body><main id="app"><section id="lobby" class="lobby"><div class="brand"><span class="mark">⌁</span> CIRCUIT<span>HUB</span></div><div class="lobby-grid"><div class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">SHARED LOGIC WORKSPACE</p><h1>Make the signal<br><em>visible.</em></h1><p class="intro">A calm, live workspace for teams thinking in gates, wires, and what comes next.</p><div class="hero-line"></div><p class="micro">No accounts. No setup spiral.<br>Choose a name and join the board.</p></div><div class="join-card"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR VISUAL IDENTIFIER</p><label>What should the room call you?<input id="name" maxlength="48" placeholder="e.g. Ada"></label><p class="hint">If someone already uses this name, we’ll give you a neat suffix.</p><button id="continue" class="primary">Continue <span>→</span></button></div></div></section>
<section id="workspace" hidden><header class="topbar"><div class="logo"><span class="mark">⌁</span> CIRCUIT<span>HUB</span></div><div class="crumb"><span id="circuit-name">Untitled circuit</span><i></i><span id="sync-status">LIVE</span></div><div class="team" id="team"></div><button id="new-circuit" class="text-btn">+ new board</button></header><div class="shell"><aside class="left-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><p>COMPONENTS</p><small>click to place</small></div><div id="palette" class="palette"></div><div class="shortcuts"><p>WORKFLOW</p><span><kbd>Click</kbd> output → input</span><span><kbd>Drag</kbd> components to move</span><span><kbd>Del</kbd> remove selected</span></div></aside><section class="studio"><div class="studio-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACTIVE BOARD</p><h2 id="board-title">Untitled circuit</h2></div><div class="actions"><button id="truth">Truth table</button><button id="demo">Load demo</button><button id="export">Export PDF</button><button id="run" class="run">▶ Run circuit</button></div></div><div class="canvas-frame"><div id="canvas" class="canvas"><svg id="wires" viewBox="0 0 1200 720" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><filter id="glow"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="2" result="blur"/><feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge></filter></defs></svg><div id="nodes"></div><div id="empty" class="empty-state"><b>Start with a signal</b><span>Choose a component on the left, then connect its pins.</span></div></div></div><div class="canvas-foot"><span id="selection-help">Select a component to edit it.</span><span>GRID <b id="grid-readout">20</b> px</span></div></section><aside class="right-panel"><div class="inspector-title"><p>INSPECTOR</p><span id="selected-type">—</span></div><div id="inspector" class="inspector"><div class="no-selection">Select a component<br>to see its signal details.</div></div><div class="signal-card"><p>SIGNAL MONITOR</p><div id="monitor"><span>No output pins yet</span></div></div></aside></div></section></main><dialog id="modal"><div id="modal-body"></div><button class="close-modal">Close</button></dialog><script src="/circuithub.js"></script></body></html>
